#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount:1 of
msgid "Cumulative count (0-indexed row number) within each group."
msgstr "每个组内的累积计数（从0开始的行号）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount:3 of
msgid ""
"Unlike the other cum* methods, ``cumcount`` counts rows (not values), is "
"NaN-agnostic, and has no ``columns`` or ``skipna`` parameters. "
"``ascending=False`` reverses the count (counts from the end)."
msgstr ""
"与其他cum*方法不同，``cumcount`` 计算行数（而不是值），对NaN不敏感，并且"
"没有 ``columns`` 或 ``skipna`` 参数。``ascending=False`` 反向计数（从末尾"
"开始计数）。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount:7 of
msgid ""
"If True, number rows from 0 upward within each group.  If False, count "
"from the last row backward."
msgstr "如果为True，在每个组内从0开始向上编号行。如果为False，从最后一行向后计数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount:11 of
msgid "Row count per group, 0-indexed."
msgstr "每组的行计数，从0开始索引。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumcount.rst
msgid "返回类型"
